{{Quote|Okay, squadron, we'll be training in the Tashtor sector.|[[Tamara Ryvora]]|<ref name="The Escape">{{Resistance|The Escape (episode)}}</ref>}}
The '''Tashtor sector''' was a [[sector]] in the [[Western Reaches]] that included the [[planet]]s [[Takodana]],<ref name="Visual" /> [[Castilon]],<ref name="The Escape" /> and [[Nordis Prime]].<ref name="Nordis Prime" /> It also included the astronomical object [[Chalcedon]].<ref name="TFABG">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens Beginner Game|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' Beginner Game]]</ref>

{{Sec-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The entry for Castilon in the [[2024]] reference book ''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]'' mistakenly places the planet, and the Tashtor sector, in the [[Outer Rim Territories]], though it places Takodana in the Western Reaches and Mid Rim.

